      "text": [
        ": سَأَلْتُهُ عَنْ طَلاَقِ اَلْمَعْتُوهِ اَلزَّائِلِ اَلْعَقْلِ أَ يَجُوزُ فَقَالَ \"لاَ\" وَ عَنِ اَلْمَرْأَةِ إِذَا كَانَتْ كَذَلِكَ يَجُوزُ بَيْعُهَا وَ صَدَقَتُهَا فَقَالَ \"لاَ\"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.4770 - Abd al-Karim ibn ʿAmr narrated from al-Ḥalabi from Abu Abdullah (as) who said:\nI asked Imam (as) about the divorce of a mentally impaired person whose intellect is diminished, whether it is permissible?\nImam (as) replied: \"No.\"\nI (narrator) also asked about a woman in the same condition, whether it is permissible to sell her property or manage her dowry?\nHe replied: \"No.\""
        ]
      }
